{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_title", "source_sha256": "76b66ccfaeab5e02e4aba049bfd82d53213df1003fea00f3d96cf78ebd9e716f", "ja": "アイドルちゃんの元気のヒケツ", "zh": "偶像活力满满的秘诀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a125250ff43564219af5a00c93a92f2804ed0cb35d5968fb2854be4af985bd1b", "ja": "新曲のお披露目公演をすることになった亜利\n沙。盛り上げる事は得意でも、盛り上げられ\nる側としては自信が持てなかったが、仲間達\nのコールを受けて元気をもらう。そうして迎\nえた公演は、大きな歓声に包まれた。", "zh": "亚利沙决定举办新曲的披露公演。虽然她很擅长炒热气氛，但作为被炒热的一方却缺乏自信，不过同伴们的呼喊声让她重获了活力。就这样迎来的公演，被巨大的欢呼声所包围。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8b379c0c4a2f8fdd75a64ac3fedeb111520b93e277bfb4165599af2f2c3cd68a", "ja": "（次の定期公演に向けて、レッスンが始まった。\n朋花と育も、みんなと合流したはず……）", "zh": "（为了下一场定期公演，训练开始了。朋花和育也应该已经和大家汇合了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "d3f5a477c4cedd97abdd08f690cecbc6948ba0b6e2f816661e251e7a2b9d86eb", "ja": "はい！　はい！　はい！　はい！\nはい！　はい！", "zh": "好！好！好！好！\n好！好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1002_028ari", "source_sha256": "6034572a91f6d8ce72e53ea53c41e6b989209d6481003d7930abdb3e9d646eb9", "ja": "イェー！！！", "zh": "耶！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1003_p", "source_sha256": "47a07d7af33fe75222b2dbefe20e5d33859ca3997106002405cca8f2f5344922", "ja": "あの声……いやコールは、もしかしなくても……。", "zh": "那个声音……不对，那声打call，难道说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "0e8c850c5ce3bf601e2d1e6b2bac156fc547e75535a67ea17199f9f9586f6e78", "ja": "えっと、こんな感じ！\nどうだったかな？", "zh": "那个，这种感觉！\n怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1005_031tom", "source_sha256": "4a5c9c8bd36394e991ce55113ff030fadaf2489d11735820b715eeec54d4a3df", "ja": "はい、悪くなかったと思いますよ～。\nみなさん、見ていてどうでしたか～？", "zh": "嗯，我觉得还不错哦～  \n大家看得感觉怎么样呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "5599dcf9b1c732f93fbbe446b5c2dda3aeeb6042a11c90e75412111f517c75e0", "ja": "最高！　最高でしたよ、育ちゃんも朋花ちゃんもっ！\nとってもキュートで、かわいかったですーっ！", "zh": "太棒了！太棒了，育和朋花都是！\n超级可爱，真的好可爱哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "dbcb447a16f5ef8d31747ba2ae98989a608e9cbce2a8cd985c2062a35f7ec80a", "ja": "フゥ。レッスンとはいえ、とってもいいものを\n見せてもらっちゃいました……ありさ、役得です♪", "zh": "呼……虽说只是练习，却让我欣赏到了特别精彩的表演……真是让阿利沙占便宜了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1008_p", "source_sha256": "a665126d1080964ba92901e00dc137512cf49e84372a55bfca0da85253dee72e", "ja": "やっぱり亜利沙だったか……。", "zh": "果然是亚利沙啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "f3554270b32f9d4a8e47c253b79f50a7e029f947d3016b79ff6ed279e095d92b", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\n今のレッスン、見てましたか！？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n刚才的练习，您看到了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b0b15d3fffa95c9579be9e5f9f0bc5923e31f42650368391fa7a7ffdc9d4b292", "ja": "最後のほうだけだけどな。\n朋花も育も、絶好調みたいだな。", "zh": "只看到最后一段了。\n不过朋花和育，看起来状态都很好嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "a4019ee1c8c5233b83e6dafbf2c305930e1df0d85afba5ed1fdd73b79a4c4042", "ja": "えへへ、そうなんだ！\nわたしたち、息がぴったりだったんだよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，是啊！\n我们配合得默契十足呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "9de7a5ba64526f8e67a9a1129640e72e8e88d9a498a720413678ded96325d4cb", "ja": "うふふ、そうですね～。\n私も、歌っていて、とても楽しかったですよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊～。我唱歌的时候，也觉得特别开心呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "83235404c346a5fdc02abf6352e8f4f64e81faa0ce28876eee4104afaa8a38fd", "ja": "聖母の朋花ちゃんと、天使の育ちゃん！\nこの組み合わせ、尊すぎます～！", "zh": "圣母朋花和天使育！这对组合也太尊贵了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "69c1e39d477bd6218568f78ed6e67d2debb623a2a36d900f67cef8d5be50bf0d", "ja": "ここはひとつ、ふたりのデュオなんてどうですか？", "zh": "不如让她们两位组成二重唱，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1015_p", "source_sha256": "45890f7ee2d480e7139d3ff2c5537d2eaaf37611b4f5bca7d04d5de1added061", "ja": "そうだな、考えておくよ。\nそれはさておき、亜利沙の新曲の方はどうなんだ？", "zh": "是啊，我会考虑的。\n先不说这个，亜利沙的新歌怎么样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "b4d83b3cb1daa42bec0ddd3ed07dde65c255c37c914ef9541d4d1b9f7d3c7fc1", "ja": "うっ！　そ、それは～、えっと……。", "zh": "呜！那、那个嘛～，呃……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "b600ff6f0716cfb89e003ab2c43e9238aeeb62bce02b6ac0738df4227ebf8bc4", "ja": "も～、それなんです！\n{$P$}さん、ちょっと見たってや！", "zh": "真是的，就是这个！  \n{$P$}先生，你先看一下嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1018_p", "source_sha256": "007f50c9cf0d8a2f32e10bb8aa68d79c9b9ef442a04c54d322e0ab1030e6248f", "ja": "そうか。じゃあ早速だけど、亜利沙の曲を\n見せてもらおうかな。亜利沙、準備はいいか？", "zh": "这样啊。那就马上开始吧，让我看看亚利沙的歌。亚利沙，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "2d50b2b49e8307c75e93f595cc4942be1d6420f7b92f7ad9cb7e65da6e7627be", "ja": "は、はいぃ……。", "zh": "是、是的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "dbb6b32632cdf743dad702d2425b6c8d1ee0df30538a16ac10ea5505fa6f8729", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ、ハァ……。\n{$P$}さん、ど、どうでしたか……？", "zh": "哈、哈、哈……  \n{$P$}先生，感、感觉怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1022_p", "source_sha256": "f998182477edad2535aab15f6e958c7a1cd4027edb86348e459df5df67326ac4", "ja": "うん、振り付けは覚えたみたいだな！\nだけど、コールの方が声が出てたのはどうしてだ？", "zh": "嗯，动作看起来是记住了！\n不过，为什么喊call的时候声音反而更大呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "fbcdb72ab1de23ea932de3a5185186dcbe712ddf250285418d249d59988ac25a", "ja": "ギクゥ！？", "zh": "咯噔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "82ac9b83f27539f1db551879ee17bf6f6dedfdd81e60ce4196082f91bb6325e2", "ja": "やっぱり、そうですよね～？\n亜利沙さん～、どういうことですか～？", "zh": "果然是这样吧～？\n亚利沙小姐～，这是怎么回事呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "2337893492fa93a657258877895d46bd57c428ca308c7084431e943699e4f9b7", "ja": "今回の公演で新曲を披露するのは、\n亜利沙さんだけなんですよ～？", "zh": "这次公演要表演新歌的，只有亚利沙小姐哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1026_037nao", "source_sha256": "2289e4ddd6ee66800a9bb9c6cb9ea40f314ae5cec8a41fb6fc8fd4037a3d720e", "ja": "せやで！　亜利沙の新曲は公演の目玉やのに、\nメッチャおとなしいとか、ありえへんやろ。", "zh": "没错！明明亚利沙的新歌是这次公演的亮点，却安静得不得了，这怎么可能嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1027_028ari", "source_sha256": "d466ce69e80002acca3456c009571f377695063aea6bbc7ced213d0156b840c0", "ja": "ええっ！？\nあ、ありさ、そんなにおとなしいですか？", "zh": "诶！？  \n啊，亚利沙有那么安静吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "b1db7718af73589520d8a63f512afa658241b625f630987791a7ae7fc2f8b6d2", "ja": "うーん、そうだね。今の亜利沙ちゃんは、元気が\n小盛りかも……あ、いつもは元気特盛りね♪", "zh": "嗯——，确实呢。现在的亚利沙可能是小份活力……啊，平时可是特大份活力哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1029_030iku", "source_sha256": "2330b52b13ad6c510b08b607e919a321a98d3eca01c56427b28962b03ac68106", "ja": "わたしも、亜利沙さん元気ないなって思ったかも。\nコールの時のほうが、楽しそうだったよ？", "zh": "我也觉得亚利沙好像没什么精神呢。\n打call的时候反而更开心的样子哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "ed70e1292997e76b6103cf58249b5b4ba381d190a4187ad9329fc15bde0c47ae", "ja": "ガーン！　育ちゃんの素直な感想が、\nありさの心に……グサっと……！", "zh": "大受打击！小育坦率的感想，狠狠地刺进了亚利沙的心……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1031_p", "source_sha256": "988e3c612a30318d610ce410f18b6c43fc2e4040827ae37aa6ab2e6ba5eaded2", "ja": "それは図星だからなんじゃ……。", "zh": "因为那正好说中了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "2980cc53fec4cbbd77b4f9a166d7487a81347d6438c142d70a066e17bf3d5a63", "ja": "うぅ……難しいですね、新曲……。ありさ、ちゃんと\n本番のステージ、盛り上げられるんでしょうか……。", "zh": "呜……新歌真难啊……阿利沙真的能把正式演出的舞台气氛炒热吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "f544431f72f2e4e98253da42003098c26fe337621b46d9250b9ab5544251bd9f", "ja": "そんなん、自信持って\nドーンと行けばええんちゃう？", "zh": "这种事，自信满满地放手一搏不就行了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "663103a10d8a637ba7afeff9164320b4c326b42e81d3601a15ecba95bd430b32", "ja": "振り付けはだいたいできてるって、\n{$P$}さんも言うてたやん。", "zh": "{$P$}先生也说过，舞蹈动作基本都已经练会了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "0fdcfb10095255795b3cfaa29b2ff62f1d2953c8818021a305e9b8bad168ab55", "ja": "そうなんですケド、その肝心の自信が\n行方不明なんですよぉ～！", "zh": "是这样没错，可偏偏最重要的自信不见踪影了呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1036_p", "source_sha256": "fae5a13caec66fc95799f39204d260f0e810a943e6c74c59fe2df29a9c776250", "ja": "なぁ、亜利沙。聞きたいんだけど……新曲だと\n遠慮がちなのに、どうしてコールは全力でいけるんだ？", "zh": "喂，亚利沙。我想问一下……明明面对新歌时会有些拘谨，为什么喊口号时却能全力以赴呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "b31772f09fbada2da9be4579f6f1a6345ce3e1deb736d6a6f829e4303560f968", "ja": "え？　それはだって、みんなキラキラした、\n最高のアイドルちゃんたちですから！", "zh": "诶？那是因为，大家都是闪闪发光的、最棒的偶像们嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "7878a2f3f0cbaa7d92c69dc14c7af95343d4dbcb74f340f29cc8ad518378d3a0", "ja": "最高のパフォーマンスには、\n最高のコールで返さないと、失礼です！", "zh": "最高的表演，\n要用最高的应援回应，不然太失礼了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "55a260afcc22a514fa7ce532b92bf011655f5dc80ba4dc462ff055618ba84ae0", "ja": "そっか。でもありさちゃんもキラキラしてるし、\n最高のアイドルなんじゃないかな？", "zh": "这样啊。不过亚利沙也在闪闪发光，说不定也是最棒的偶像吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1040_028ari", "source_sha256": "361edc5cf60214ff52c10dee1b06eeea6525e45e1a7e2b9cb982ffd463f49799", "ja": "ふぇっ？", "zh": "诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1041_030iku", "source_sha256": "7c5f701a45c5d31f1c27d83d6719e286571c97b9fdf43f4d589dbc76863a4e9d", "ja": "あっ、わかったよ！　わたしたちで、\nさっきみたいに亜利沙さんを応えんすればいいのかも！", "zh": "啊，我明白了！我们可以像刚才那样，为亚利沙小姐加油，说不定就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1042_019min", "source_sha256": "b8042b1f625def7ab9984049903214290dc042d6a68604d796fb817ad24abe94", "ja": "さっきみたいに……あっ、もしかして！", "zh": "就像刚才那样……啊，难道是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "10bb9700de0f85b8b350f39298e8b1f5065a7bd38a34fb599d0e4448c42efd6f", "ja": "せや！　コール&レスポンスやな！", "zh": "对了！就是一问一答嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "bac7f6b125a6f4554e98c85dc44a1deefc9f882ec33e0a56c4ecb9cbd42adc01", "ja": "えっ……えーっ！？\nコール&レスポンスって、ありさにですかぁ！？", "zh": "咦……诶——！？\n要让有纱来做互动问答吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1045_031tom", "source_sha256": "27faa92f1f57633ce609cccc1f8f47938b1dac0457fad7a846f2015ad4fd06f3", "ja": "なるほど、いい考えかもしれませんね～。\nそれではさっそく、やってみましょう～。", "zh": "原来如此，说不定是个好主意呢～。\n那么我们马上试试吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_052_1046_031tom", "source_sha256": "4caf73798f4b14b50f84c129fd6f70d2585e34ad51e281280766238279889c96", "ja": "亜利沙さん、準備はいいですか～？\n{$P$}さんも手伝ってくださいね～。", "zh": "亚利沙，准备好了吗～？\n也请{$P$}先生帮忙哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
